hadiths[34]{hadithnumber,text}:
"134","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah tum mein se kisi ki namaz qubool nahi farmata jab wo be-wuzu ho, yahan tak ke wo wuzu kare."
"135","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne bartan mangwaya aur apni hatheliyon par teen martaba pani dala aur unhe dhoya. Phir apna dayan hath bartan mein dala, kulli ki aur naak mein pani dala. Phir apna chehra teen martaba dhoya, aur apne dono hath kohniyon tak teen martaba dhoye. Phir apne sar ka masah kiya, phir apne dono paon takhnon tak teen martaba dhoye. Phir farmaya: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo mere is wuzu jaisa wuzu kare phir do rakatein parhe aur un mein apne dil mein khayal na laye to us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"136","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke wuzu ke bare mein poochha gaya. To unhon ne pani ka ek bartan mangwaya aur unhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka wuzu karke dikhaya. Phir unhon ne bartan se apne hath par pani undela aur apne dono hath teen martaba dhoye. Phir apna hath bartan mein dala, kulli ki, naak mein pani dala aur teen lap se naak jhaadi. Phir apna hath dala aur apna chehra teen martaba dhoya. Phir apne dono hath kohniyon tak do martaba dhoye. Phir apna hath dala aur apne sar ka masah kiya, apne dono hathon ko aage laya aur peechhe le gaya, ek martaba. Phir apne dono paon takhnon tak dhoye."
"137","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare use chahiye ke naak jhaade, aur jo dhelon se istinja kare use chahiye ke taaq adad mein kare."
"138","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se bedar ho aur wuzu kare to use chahiye ke teen martaba naak jhaade, kyunke shaitan us ki naak ke baansay par raat guzarta hai."
"139","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek safar mein jo hum ne kiya, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hum se peechhe reh gaye. To Aap ne hamein pa liya jabke namaz ne hamein tang kar diya tha, aur hum wuzu kar rahe they. To hum apne paon par masah karne lage. Phir Aap ne buland awaz se pukara: Ediyon ke liye Aag se halakat ho! Do ya teen martaba."
"140","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) guzarte they jabke log wuzu-khane se wuzu kar rahe they. To unhon ne farmaya: Wuzu poora karo, kyunke Abu al-Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ediyon ke liye Aag se halakat ho!"
"141","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Beshak meri ummat Qayamat ke din wuzu ke nishanon se roshan peshani aur roshan hath-paon wali bulayi jayegi. To tum mein se jo apni roshni lambi kar sake use chahiye ke aisa kare."
"142","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar main apni ummat par, ya logon par mushqqat na dalta to unhe har namaz ke sath miswak ka hukm deta."
"143","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ko paya ke Aap apne hath se miswak kar rahe they, Aap farma rahe they: U' u', jabke miswak Aap ke munh mein thi goya Aap ko ulti aa rahi thi."
"144","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab raat mein uthte to miswak se apna munh saaf karte."
"145","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Fitrat paanch hain, ya fitrat mein se paanch hain: Khatna, naaf ke neeche baal saaf karna, baghal ke baal ukhedna, nakhun katna aur moonchhen katna."
"146","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Mushrikon ki mukhalifat karo, dadheyan badhao aur moonchhen patli karo."
"147","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Moonchhen khoob kato aur dadheyan badhao."
"148","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum qaza-e-hajat ke liye jao to na Qibla ki taraf munh karo aur na us ki taraf peeth karo, lekin mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf karo. Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Phir hum Sham aaye to hum ne paikhane Qibla ki taraf bane hue paye. To hum hat jate aur Allah Ta'ala se maghfirat mangte."
"149","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo kehte they: Log kehte hain ke jab tum apni hajat ke liye baitho to na Qibla ki taraf munh karo aur na Bait al-Maqdis ki taraf. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: Ek din main hamare ek ghar ki chhat par chadha to main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko do eenton par Bait al-Maqdis ki taraf munh kiye apni hajat ke liye dekha."
"150","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main apni ek hajat ke liye Hafsa ke ghar ki chhat par chadha to main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Aap apni hajat poori kar rahe they, Qibla ki taraf peeth kiye, Sham ki taraf munh kiye."
"151","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi piye to bartan mein saans na le, aur jab bait al-khala jaye to apne dayan hath se apne satr ko na chhue aur na dayan hath se istinja kare."
"152","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apne joota pehenne, kanghi karne, taharat mein aur apne har kaam mein dayan taraf pasand thi."
"153","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bait al-khala mein dakhil hote to main aur ek ladka pani ka bartan aur neza uthate. Aap pani se istinja farmate."
"154","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab apni hajat ke liye farigh hote to main Aap ke paas pani lata to Aap us se ghusl farmate [istinja farmate]."
"155","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne peshab kiya phir wuzu kiya aur apne mozon par masah kiya, phir khade hue aur namaz parhi. To un se poochha gaya. To unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aisa karte dekha hai."
"156","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne aap ko aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sath chalte dekha. Phir Aap deewar ke peechhe ek qaum ke kachre par aaye aur khade ho gaye jaise tum mein se ek khada hota hai. Phir Aap ne peshab farmaya. To main Aap se hat gaya. Phir Aap ne meri taraf ishara farmaya to main Aap ke paas aaya. Phir main Aap ki edi ke paas khada raha yahan tak ke Aap farigh ho gaye."
"157","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap apni hajat ke liye nikle. To Mughira Aap ke peechhe pani ka bartan lekar chale jis mein pani tha. Phir jab Aap apni hajat se farigh hue to unhon ne Aap par pani dala. Phir Aap ne wuzu farmaya aur mozon par masah kiya."
"158","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek safar mein tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Mughira! Bartan pakdo. To main ne use pakda. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chale yahan tak ke mujh se ojhal ho gaye. Phir Aap ne apni hajat poori ki jabke Aap par Shaami jubba tha. Phir Aap ne us ki aasteen se apna hath nikalna chaha to wo tang thi. To Aap ne us ke neeche se apna hath nikala. Phir main ne Aap par pani dala. To Aap ne namaz ke wuzu jaisa wuzu farmaya aur apne mozon par masah kiya, phir namaz parhi."
"159","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ek raat safar mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas pani hai? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Phir Aap apni sawari se utre aur chale yahan tak ke raat ke andhere mein mujh se ojhal ho gaye. Phir Aap aaye to main ne Aap par bartan se pani dala. Phir Aap ne apna chehra aur apne hath dhoye jabke Aap par oon ka jubba tha. To Aap apne dono bazu us se nikal na sake yahan tak ke unhe jubbe ke neeche se nikala. Phir Aap ne apne dono bazu dhoye, phir apne sar ka masah kiya. Phir main Aap ke mozey utarne ke liye jhuka. To Aap ne farmaya: Unhe rehne do, kyunke main ne unhe taharat par pehna tha. Phir Aap ne un par masah kiya."
"160","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein piye to use chahiye ke use saat martaba dhoye."
"161","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi thehre hue pani mein jo behta na ho, peshab na kare phir us mein ghusl kare."
"162","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati ne masjid mein peshab kiya. To log us ki taraf uth khade hue. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use na roko. Phir Aap ne pani ka ek dol mangwaya aur us par bahaya gaya."
"163","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas bachche laye jate to Aap un ke liye dua farmate. Phir ek bachcha laya gaya to us ne Aap ke kapde par peshab kar diya. To Aap ne pani mangwaya aur us ke peechhe bahaya aur use dhoya nahi."
"164","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Qais bint Mihsan (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo apne ek chhote bete ko jo khana nahi khata tha, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas layein. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use apni god mein bithaya. Phir us ne Aap ke kapde par peshab kar diya. To Aap ne pani mangwaya aur us par chhente mare aur use dhoya nahi."
"165","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se mani ke kapde ko lagne ke bare mein poochha gaya. To unhon ne farmaya: Main use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke kapde se dhoti thi, phir Aap namaz ke liye niklte jabke Aap ke kapde mein dhone ka nishan hota, pani ke dhabbey."
"166","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur arz kiya: Batayiye, hum mein se ek ko kapde mein haiz aaye to wo kya kare? Aap ne farmaya: Use khurache, phir use pani se mal kar dhoye aur us par chhente mare, phir us mein namaz parhe."
"167","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) do qabron ke paas se guzre. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak unhe azab diya ja raha hai, aur unhe kisi badi cheez mein azab nahi diya ja raha. Raha un mein se ek, wo peshab se nahi bachta tha. Aur raha doosra, wo chughli karta phirta tha. Phir Aap ne khajoor ki ek tari tehni li aur use do hisson mein cheera. Phir har qabr mein ek gaad di. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne ye kyun kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Shayad un se halka kiya jaye jab tak wo khushk na hon."
